{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "streaming/a-reader-that-stops-ends-the-turn-while-its-agent-holds-its-next-piece",
  "title": "A streaming target that stops reading at a text piece ends the turn at once, while the agent behind it holds what follows",
  "rules": [
    "§10.6.4",
    "§12.2 step 13s"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-10.6.4-010"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: turns/_executor_turn.py _cut_read, which a close runs when turns/_executor_pulls.py PullGate.close finds the executor reading ahead past a delta. The scripted ACP agent sends one text piece, then holds at a gate no step opens: past that piece, which the reader stops at, the executor reads ahead and waits for the agent. A close that let that read go on would wait for the gate, and the turn would never end. A read only a later pull let start, a call running past its start, is not shown: no fixture has a reader close while a read it asked for is pending.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "ws",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport",
        "streams": true,
        "deliver_stream": [
          {
            "stop_after": "Anchor"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "claude",
        "type": "ai",
        "acp": {
          "cwd": "/srv/project",
          "agent": {
            "prompts": [
              {
                "updates": [
                  {
                    "sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk",
                    "content": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Anchor"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "after_updates_gate": "never-released"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "ws"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "claude",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "ws",
        "sender_id": "alice",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Hello"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "streamed": {
      "room-1": {
        "ws": [
          {
            "text": "Anchor"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
